---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<section class="sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:pt-24 pt-24 pr-5 pb-24 pl-5" id="cta">
<div class="reveal overflow-hidden border-ink/[0.11] shadow-ink/20 sm:px-10 sm:py-10 lg:px-12 lg:py-12 bg-paper/[0.70] w-full max-w-[1280px] border rounded-[2rem] mr-auto ml-auto pt-8 pr-6 pb-8 pl-6 relative shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-2xl">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent-ink/10 blur-3xl"></div>
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-28 left-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-ink/10 blur-3xl"></div>
<div class="relative flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
<div class="max-w-3xl">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent-ink/10 bg-accent-ink/[0.04] px-3 py-1">
<span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-ink"></span>
<p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-accent-ink">Comece em minutos</p>
</div>
<h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl tracking-tighter text-ink sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-display font-medium">Dê ao seu time um lugar claro para gerenciar o trabalho.</h2>
<p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft sm:text-base">Sem cartão de crédito. Crie seu primeiro projeto, convide seu time e veja cada prazo em um único espaço tranquilo.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row lg:flex-col xl:flex-row">
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-paper shadow-2xl shadow-ink/30 transition duration-300 ease-out hover:scale-[1.03] hover:bg-accent-ink-strong" href="#pricing">
Iniciar teste grátis
<Icon name="solar:arrow-right-linear" width={18} height={18} />
</a>
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ink/[0.11] bg-paper/[0.55] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-paper/[0.85] hover:text-ink" href="#how">Ver como funciona</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
